#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable All Thresholds"
msgstr "Ataovy tsy mavitrika ny Fetra rehetra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will disable Alerting on all Thresholds.  This can be used when it is necessary to perform maintenance on your network."
msgstr "Ny fanamarihana ity boaty ity dia hanafoana ny fanairana amin'ny Fetra rehetra. Azo ampiasaina izany rehefa ilaina ny manao fikojakojana eo amin'ny tambajotranao."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Auto Create Thresholds"
msgstr "Famoronana fetra ho azy"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If selected, when running either automation, or when creating/saving a Device, all Thresholds associated with the Device Template will be created."
msgstr "Raha voafidy, rehefa mandefa automatique na rehefa mamorona/mitahiry Fitaovana, dia hoforonina avokoa ny Fetra rehetra mifandraika amin'ny Modely Fitaovana."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Raiso ho aotra ny angona tsy fantatra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When checking Thresholds, if a Data Source returns Unknown Data ('U'), consider the value as zero for the Threshold check. You can also enable log this issue."
msgstr "Rehefa manamarina Fetra, raha mamerina Angona tsy fantatra ('U') ny Loharanon'angona iray, dia raiso ho aotra ny sanda amin'ny fanamarinana Fetra. Azonao atao koa ny mampavitrika ny firaketana an'ity olana ity."

