msgstr "Mavitrika"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Empty ifHighSpeed Default"
msgstr "Sanda fototra raha banga ny ifHighSpeed"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When calculating Expression Thresholds, if the ifHighSpeed and ifSpeed come back as zero, use the following ifHighSpeed setting instead.  Default ifHighSpeed will be 10000 for 10GE interfaces."
msgstr "Rehefa manao kajy ny Fetra amin'ny teny fanehoana, raha miverina ho aotra ny ifHighSpeed sy ifSpeed, dia ampiasao ity fandrindrana ifHighSpeed manaraka ity. Ny ifHighSpeed mahazatra dia ho 10000 ho an'ny mpampifandray 10GE."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Notification Preferences"
msgstr "Safidin'ny fampandrenesana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Legacy Notifications"
msgstr "Ataovy tsy mavitrika ny fampandrenesana taloha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will disable Legacy Alerting on all Thresholds.  Legacy Alerting is defined as any Specific Email Alerts not associated with a Notification List."
msgstr "Ny fanamarihana ity boaty ity dia hanafoana ny fanairana taloha amin'ny Fetra rehetra. Ny fanairana taloha dia ireo fanairana Mailaka manokana tsy mifandray amin'ny lisitry ny fampandrenesana."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Notification Templated"
msgstr "Fampandrenesana Fetra Mampiasa Modely"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating at Threshold Template, its Notification Settings will, by default be owned by the Threshold Template."
msgstr "Raha voamarika, rehefa mamorona Modely Fetra, dia ho an'ny Modely Fetra ny Fandrindrana Fampahafantarana azy amin'ny fomba mahazatra."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Command Execution"
msgstr "Alefaso ny fanatanterahana baiko"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to run commands on Threshold breach and restoral events."
msgstr "Ny fanamarihana ity boaty ity dia hampavitrika ny fahafahana mandefa baiko amin'ny hetsika fihoarana sy fiverenana amin'ny laoniny ny Fetra."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Per Thold Notification"
msgstr "Alefaso ny fampandrenesana isaky ny Thold"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to maintain custom Email bodies for Thresholds."
msgstr "Ny fanamarihana ity boaty ity dia hampavitrika ny fahafahana mitazona votoatin'ny Mailaka manokana ho an'ny Fetra."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notification Queue"
msgstr "Alefaso ny filaharana fampandrenesana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will switch Thold from performing inline Notification to using either the Notification Daemon, or notifications performed out of band by the Notification poller."
msgstr "Ny fanamarihana ity boaty ity dia hanova ny Thold tsy hanao fampandrenesana mivantana fa hampiasa ny Notification Daemon, na fampandrenesana tanterahin'ny Poller fampandrenesana ivelan'ny zotra."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Sending Alert Emails to Warning Notification Lists"
msgstr "Alefaso ny fandefasana mailaka fanairana any amin'ny lisitra fampandrenesana Fampitandremana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Check this box if you wish Warning Notification List recipients to receive Alert Emails in addition to the Alert Notification list receivers.  This case is applicable when Warning Notifications goes to Administrators and Alert Notifications go to Management."
msgstr "Mariho ity boaty ity raha tianao handray mailaka fampitandremana mahery vaika ireo ao amin'ny lisitry ny fampandrenesana Fampitandremana ho fanampin'ireo mpandray ao amin'ny lisitry ny fampandrenesana fanairana. Miasa izany rehefa mandeha any amin'ny Mpitantana ny fampandrenesana Fampitandremana ary mandeha any amin'ny Fitantanana kosa ny fampandrenesana fanairana."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Daemon Fetra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Alefaso ny daemon'ny Fetra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the use of a dedicated Threshold daemon. This can be used to increase system performance and/or to distribute Threshold monitoring to a separate server."
msgstr "Ny fanamarihana ity boaty ity dia hampavitrika ny fampiasana daemon Fetra natokana. Azo ampiasaina izany mba hampitomboana ny fahombiazan'ny rafitra sy/na hizarana ny fanaraha-maso Fetra amin'ny lohamilina hafa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Force Threshold Daemon Debug"
msgstr "Terena ny Debug amin'ny Daemon Fetra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable Threshold Daemon debug when operating from SystemD or through the command line.  This change is dynamic and will take effect as soon as the next Threshold loop commences."
msgstr "Ny fanamarihana ity boaty ity dia hampavitrika ny fizahana hadisoana amin'ny Threshold Daemon rehefa miasa avy amin'ny SystemD na amin'ny alalan'ny andalana baiko. Miova eo no ho eo izany ary hanomboka manan-kery raha vao manomboka ny tsingerina Fetra manaraka."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Down Notification Frequency"
msgstr "Fahatetehan'ny fampandrenesana rehefa tsy mandeha ny Daemon"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If the Thold Daemon is found to be down, send out an Email notification at this frequency."
msgstr "Raha hita fa maty ny Thold Daemon, mandefasa fampahafantarana amin'ny Mailaka amin'izao elanelam-potoana izao."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d Hour"
msgstr "Isaky ny %d ora"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Threads"
msgstr "Fizaran'asan'ny Daemon"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The number of daemon threads to be handled by the Threshold Daemon."
msgstr "Ny isan'ny kofehy daemon horaisin'ny Daemon Fetra."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 Dingana"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d Dingana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Firaketana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Breaches"
msgstr "Raketo ny fandikana ny Fetra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold failures to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Ataovy mavitrika ny fitahirizana ny tsy fahombiazana rehetra amin'ny Fetra ao amin'ny Diarin'i Cacti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show Data Source in Log"
msgstr "Asehoy ao amin'ny diarin'asa ny loharanon'angona"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show the Data Source name in the Log if not present."
msgstr "Asehoy ao amin'ny diarin'asa ny anaran'ny loharanon'angona raha tsy misy izany."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Changes"
msgstr "Raketo ny fiovan'ny Fetra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold changes to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Ataovy mavitrika ny fitahirizana ny fanovana rehetra amin'ny Fetra ao amin'ny Diarin'i Cacti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Debug Log"
msgstr "Firaketana fitiliana hadisoana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of debug messages with Threshold"
msgstr "Ataovy mavitrika ny fitahirizana ny hafatra fanitsiana olana (debug) miaraka amin'ny Fetra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Log Retention"
msgstr "Fitazonana ny laogin'ny fampandrenesana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep Threshold Logs for this number of days."
msgstr "Tehirizo mandritra izay andro izay ny firaketana Fetra."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log action Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Raketo ny hetsika Hevero ho Aotra ny angona tsy fantatra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When 'Consider Unknown Data as Zero' is enabled, log when it occurs"
msgstr "Rehefa mavitrika ny 'Heviho ho aotra ny angona tsy fantatra', raketo an-tsoratra rehefa mitranga izany"

#: includes/settings.php thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Syslog Settings"
msgstr "Fandrindrana Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "Syslog Mavitrika"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating a new Threshold, by default new Threshold events will be sent to your local syslog.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Raha voamarika, rehefa mamorona Fetra vaovao, dia halefa any amin'ny syslog eo an-toerana ireo hetsika Fetra vaovao amin'ny alalan'ny fandrindrana fototra. Fandrindrana mialoha izany. Ny fandrindran'ny Fetra no mamaritra ny tena fifehezana ny syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Priority/Level"
msgstr "Laharam-pahamehana/Ambaratonga mahazatra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Priority/Level that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Ity ny Laharam-pahamehana/Ambaratonga mahazatra hampiasain'ny Thold handefasana hafatra syslog. Ity fandrindrana ity dia fandrindrana mialoha. Ny fandrindran'ny Fetra no mibaiko ny tena fifehezana syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Facility"
msgstr "Facility mahazatra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Facility that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Ity ny Facility mahazatra hampiasain'ny Thold handefasana hafatra syslog. Ity fandrindrana ity dia fandrindrana mialoha. Ny fandrindran'ny Fetra no mibaiko ny tena fifehezana syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Presets"
msgstr "Fandrindrana mialoha ny fampandrenesana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Weekend exemptions"
msgstr "Fanavahana faran'ny herinandro"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Thold will not run on weekends."
msgstr "Raha voamarika ity, dia tsy handeha amin'ny faran'ny herinandro ny Thold."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Trigger Count"
msgstr "Isan'ny fampandehanana mahazatra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Isa mahazatra ny fotoana mifanesy tsy maintsy handikan'ny Loharanon'angona ny Fetra mba hamoahana Fanairana."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Re-Alerting"
msgstr "Fampandrenesana miverina"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat Alert after specified number of poller cycles."
msgstr "Avereno ny fampandrenesana rehefa dila ny isan'ny tsingerin'ny Poller voafaritra."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Presets"
msgstr "Fandrindrana mari-pototra efa voaomana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Time Range Default"
msgstr "Fotoana mahazatra ho an'ny mari-pototra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default value used in creating Thresholds or templates."
msgstr "Ity ny sanda mahazatra ampiasaina amin'ny famoronana Fetra na modely."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Trigger Count"
msgstr "Isan'ny fampihetsika mari-pototra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the calculated Baseline Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Isa mahazatra ny fotoana mifanesy tsy maintsy handikan'ny Loharanon'angona ny Fetra fototra voakajy mba hamoahana Fanairana."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Deviation Percentage"
msgstr "Isan-jaton'ny fiviliana amin'ny mari-pototra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notification Options"
msgstr "Safidy fampandrenesana SNMP"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notifications"
msgstr "Fampandrenesana SNMP"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold status messages (informs/traps) will be sent to SNMP notification receivers. This includes Alerts, Warnings and Restoration traps per default. Note: This feature requires the Cacti SNMPAgent plugin."
msgstr "Halefa any amin'ireo mpandray fampandrenesana SNMP ny hafatra momba ny satan'ny Fetra (informs/traps). Tafiditra ao anatin'izany ny Fanairana, ny Fampitandremana ary ny traps famerenana amin'ny laoniny amin'ny fomba mahazatra. Fanamarihana: Mitaky ny plugin SNMPAgent an'ny Cacti ity endri-javatra ity."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Warning Notifications"
msgstr "Ataovy tsy mavitrika ny fampandrenesana fampitandremana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when a warning Threshold has been breached."
msgstr "Raha voamarika ity, dia tsy handefa fampahafantarana ny Fetra rehefa voahitsakitsaka ny Fetra Fampitandremana."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Restoration Notifications"
msgstr "Ataovy tsy mavitrika ny fampandrenesana famerenana amin'ny laoniny"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when the Threshold has returned to normal status."
msgstr "Raha voamarika ity, dia tsy handefa fampahafantarana ny Fetra rehefa niverina amin'ny sata ara-dalàna ny Fetra."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "Safidy fandefasana mailaka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Emails with Urgent Priority"
msgstr "Alefaso miaraka amin'ny laharam-pahamehana maika ny Mailaka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allows you to set Emails with urgent priority"
msgstr "Mamela anao hametraka Mailaka manana laharam-pahamehana maika"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Alerts as Text"
msgstr "Alefaso ho lahatsoratra ny fanairana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Alerts to be sent as plain text Emails with no graph.  The default is HTML Emails with the graph embedded in the Email."
msgstr "Raha voamarika, dia halefa amin'ny endrika Mailaka lahatsoratra tsotra tsy misy kisary ny Fampandrenesana rehetra. Ny mahazatra dia Mailaka HTML misy ny Kisary tafiditra ao anatiny."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Email separately for each address"
msgstr "Alefaso mitokana ny Mailaka ho an'ny adiresy tsirairay"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Emails to be sent separately for each address."
msgstr "Raha voamarika, dia halefa mitokana isaky ny adiresy ny Mailaka rehetra."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Adiresy mailaka mpandefa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Ity ny adiresy Mailaka izay hiseho ho mpandefa ny Fetra."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Anaran'ny mpandefa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Ity ny tena anarana izay hiseho ho niavian'ny Fetra."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Options"
msgstr "Safidy fampandrenesana fitaovana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notifications"
msgstr "Alefaso ny fampandrenesana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Dead/Recovering host notification"
msgstr "Alefaso ny fampandrenesana mpampiantrano maty/miverina velona"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Single Email Notification"
msgstr "Fampandrenesana mailaka tokana"

