msgstr "Safidy fankatoavana"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "There are three Acknowledgment levels that control how you must respond to a Threshold breach condition.  They are:<br><br><ul><li><i>None Required</i> - When you select this option, no Acknowledgment is required for a Threshold breach.</li><li><i>Suspendible Notification</i> - With this option, once you Acknowledge or Suspend Notifications on the Threshold, you will no longer receive notifications while it is breached.  You may subsequently, Resume Notifications while its breached.</li><li><i>Persistent Acknowledgment</i> - With this option, even after the Threshold has returned to normal, you must Acknowledge the Threshold and provide an optional Operator Message.</li></ul>"
msgstr "Misy ambaratonga Fanekena telo izay mifehy ny fomba tsy maintsy hamalianao ny fihoarana Fetra. Ireto avy izy ireo:<br><br><ul><li><i>Tsy Ilaina</i> - Rehefa misafidy ity safidy ity ianao dia tsy ilaina ny Fanekena rehefa misy fihoarana Fetra.</li><li><i>Fampahafantarana Azo Ajanona</i> - Amin'ity safidy ity, raha vao Manaiky na Manajanona ny Fampahafantarana amin'ny Fetra ianao dia tsy hahazo fampahafantarana intsony mandritra ny fihoarany. Azonao atao ny Mamerina ny Fampahafantarana avy eo mandritra ny fihoarany.</li><li><i>Fanekena Maharitra</i> - Amin'ity safidy ity, na dia efa niverina amin'ny laoniny aza ny Fetra, dia tsy maintsy Manaiky ny Fetra ianao ary manome Hafatry ny Mpandrindra raha tiana.</li></ul>"

