#: thold.php
#, php-format
msgid "An RPN Expression is an RRDtool Compatible RPN Expression.  Syntax includes all functions below in addition to both Device and Data Query replacement expressions such as <span class=\"deviceUp\">|query_ifSpeed|</span>.  To use a Data Source in the RPN Expression, you must use the syntax: <span class=\"deviceUp\">|ds:dsname|</span>.  For example, <span class=\"deviceUp\">|ds:traffic_in|</span> will get the current value of the traffic_in Data Source for the RRDfile(s) associated with the Graph. Any Data Source for a Graph can be included.<br><br>Math Operators: <span class=\"deviceUp\">+, -, /, *, &#37;, ^</span><br>Functions: <span class=\"deviceUp\">SIN, COS, TAN, ATAN, SQRT, FLOOR, CEIL, DEG2RAD, RAD2DEG, ABS, EXP, LOG, ATAN, ADNAN</span><br>Flow Operators: <span class=\"deviceUp\">UN, ISINF, IF, LT, LE, GT, GE, EQ, NE</span><br>Comparison Functions: <span class=\"deviceUp\">MAX, MIN, INF, NEGINF, NAN, UNKN, COUNT, PREV</span>%s %s"
msgstr "Ny Fomba Fiteny RPN dia Fomba Fiteny RPN mifanaraka amin'ny RRDtool. Ny rafi-panoratana dia ahitana ny asa rehetra eto ambany miaraka amin'ny fomba fiteny fanoloana ho an'ny Fitaovana sy ny Fangatahana Angona toy ny <span class=\"deviceUp\">|query_ifSpeed|</span>. Mba hampiasana Loharanon'angona ao amin'ny Fomba Fiteny RPN dia tsy maintsy mampiasa ity rafi-panoratana ity ianao: <span class=\"deviceUp\">|ds:dsname|</span>. Ohatra, ny <span class=\"deviceUp\">|ds:traffic_in|</span> dia haka ny sanda ankehitriny an'ny Loharanon'angona traffic_in ho an'ny rakitra RRD mifandray amin'ny Kisary. Azo ampidirina ny Loharanon'angona rehetra ho an'ny Kisary iray.<br><br>Mpandraharaha Matematika: <span class=\"deviceUp\">+, -, /, *, &#37;, ^</span><br>Asa: <span class=\"deviceUp\">SIN, COS, TAN, ATAN, SQRT, FLOOR, CEIL, DEG2RAD, RAD2DEG, ABS, EXP, LOG, ATAN, ADNAN</span><br>Mpandraharaha Fikoriana: <span class=\"deviceUp\">UN, ISINF, IF, LT, LE, GT, GE, EQ, NE</span><br>Asa Fampitahana: <span class=\"deviceUp\">MAX, MIN, INF, NEGINF, NAN, UNKN, COUNT, PREV</span>%s %s"

