#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "High Trigger Command"
msgstr "Baiko fanetsiketsehana ambony"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, and if a High Threshold is breached, this command will be run.  Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data Input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Raha voafaritra, ary raha voahitsakitsaka ny Fetra Ambony, dia halefa ity baiko ity. Azafady mampidira baiko manan-kery. Ankoatra izany, dia misy marika fanoloana maromaro azo ampiasaina mba hampitana vaovao avy amin'ny Fetra mankany amin'ny script. Azonao atao amin'ny endrika arguments eo amin'ny tsipika baiko izany, na ny tsara kokoa, ao amin'ny tontolon'ny script. Hiseho ao amin'ny tontolon'ny script misy tovana aloha THOLD_ ny sanda fanoloana rehetra. Noho izany, ohatra ny CURRENTVALUE dia ho lasa THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, sy ny sisa. Ny variables dia ahitana: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Farany, azo atao ny fanoloana Mpampiantrano, Data Query ary Data Input. Ohatra, raha manana angona manokana data input antsoina hoe pending ianao, ampiasao |pending| mba hanaovana ny fanoloana. Ho an'ny fanoloana Data Query sy Mpampiantrano dia ampiasao ny fomba fanaon'ny Cacti |query_xxxx| sy |host_xxxx| tsirairay avy."

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Low Trigger Command"
msgstr "Baiko fanairana ambany"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, and if a Low Threshold is breached, this command will be run. Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Raha voafaritra, ary raha voahitsakitsaka ny Fetra Ambany, dia halefa ity baiko ity. Azafady mampidira baiko manan-kery. Ankoatra izany, dia misy marika fanoloana maromaro azo ampiasaina mba hampitana vaovao avy amin'ny Fetra mankany amin'ny script. Azonao atao amin'ny endrika arguments eo amin'ny tsipika baiko izany, na ny tsara kokoa, ao amin'ny tontolon'ny script. Hiseho ao amin'ny tontolon'ny script misy tovana aloha THOLD_ ny sanda fanoloana rehetra. Noho izany, ohatra ny CURRENTVALUE dia ho lasa THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, sy ny sisa. Ny variables dia ahitana: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Farany, azo atao ny fanoloana Mpampiantrano, Data Query ary Data Input. Ohatra, raha manana angona manokana data input antsoina hoe pending ianao, ampiasao |pending| mba hanaovana ny fanoloana. Ho an'ny fanoloana Data Query sy Mpampiantrano dia ampiasao ny fomba fanaon'ny Cacti |query_xxxx| sy |host_xxxx| tsirairay avy."

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Norm Trigger Command"
msgstr "Baiko fanairana ara-dalàna"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, when a thold falls back to a normal value, this command will be run.  Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Raha voafaritra, rehefa miverina amin'ny sanda ara-dalàna ny thold, dia halefa ity baiko ity. Azafady mampidira baiko manan-kery. Ankoatra izany, dia misy marika fanoloana maromaro azo ampiasaina mba hampitana vaovao avy amin'ny Fetra mankany amin'ny script. Azonao atao amin'ny endrika arguments eo amin'ny tsipika baiko izany, na ny tsara kokoa, ao amin'ny tontolon'ny script. Hiseho ao amin'ny tontolon'ny script misy tovana aloha THOLD_ ny sanda fanoloana rehetra. Noho izany, ohatra ny CURRENTVALUE dia ho lasa THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, sy ny sisa. Ny variables dia ahitana: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Farany, azo atao ny fanoloana Mpampiantrano, Data Query ary Data Input. Ohatra, raha manana angona manokana data input antsoina hoe pending ianao, ampiasao |pending| mba hanaovana ny fanoloana. Ho an'ny fanoloana Data Query sy Mpampiantrano dia ampiasao ny fomba fanaon'ny Cacti |query_xxxx| sy |host_xxxx| tsirairay avy."

